# No committed lockfile: DSHA re-resolves prod deps online and digest-checks
# the plugin tree; a committed lock can never match a fresh --prod
# resolution, so shipping one fails install with
# "插件源码在依赖准备期间变化，未进入安装". Local `pnpm install` still
# generates one for development; it just stays out of the repo.
pnpm-lock.yaml
